; P12 scan must already be configured and all axes homed.
; Bounds/spacing require verified probe and nozzle clearance over the full grid.
; Explicit execution defines the grid, scans, saves and activates the new RAM mesh.
if !exists(global.cartographerV3MeshEnabled)
  global cartographerV3MeshEnabled = false
if !global.cartographerV3MeshEnabled
  abort "@MESH_MESSAGE@"
M558.9 S8
M557 X@MESH_X_MIN_MM@:@MESH_X_MAX_MM@ Y@MESH_Y_MIN_MM@:@MESH_Y_MAX_MM@ S@MESH_SPACING_MM@
G29 S0 K@PROBE_INDEX@ P"@HEIGHTMAP_FILE@"
